====== Intenso 2,5" Memory 2 Move USB 3.0 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

Small WiFi/Ethernet NAS device with a 3000mAh Li-polymer [[#Tags|rechargeable_battery]].
It provides 150MBit/s 802.11bgn wireless connectivity, it has a 10M/100M Fast Ethernet port and a multi-purpose USB 3.0 micro-b socket,
which can be used to access the built-in 2,5" harddisk directly and charge the rechargeable battery.

